{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Build-only pin (never run — it would hit the network). A json/dict body post builds http.request with\na Body; sending a file builds http.upload. HttpBuildPinTests (C#) asserts this committed .pr so a later\nrebuild that drifts post-with-body back to http.upload goes red.",
  "step": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "post 'https://api.example.com/speech', headers Authorization: \"Bearer %key%\", body {\"model\": \"tts\", \"input\": \"hi\"}, write to %audio%",
